 I assume I wrote unpaid for  I think six months to a year when I  first started out and that's kind of  just the reality of this kind of field  but lastly if you have any questions let  me know and if anyone writes a review  that they publish online link it to me  on my Facebook page probably and I would  be more than happy to find some time to  read it and give you some feedback  because honestly getting feedback from  people even if it's just like someone  you know who's a good writer  is the best way to grow and everyone  needs feedback I still need feedback and  of course last but not least is try not  to read the comments because no matter  what people will disagree with you it  doesn't matter the review is an opinion  keep writing don't let it just hot in  here and if you're passionate about it  you're a passionate writer then maybe  you'll be able to end up doing it  full-time one day wouldn't that be cool  I wanna I hope you guys enjoyed this  video I will see you all next time

